Terminate the proxy with nginx as a virtualHost keyed by the hostname. Route
all requests through a single location "/" whose proxyPass points at the
upstream URL. Enable services.nginx. Reference the hostname and the upstream
URL as string values, not Nix path literals.

In rule target paths, write an attrsOf key (such as the nginx location "/")
as a BARE segment with no surrounding quotes -- for example
services.nginx.virtualHosts.<self>.locations./.proxyPass -- because the kernel
quotes special characters itself. Do not write the key as "/".
